      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Tyler fled suit, alleging that the County had unconstitutionally retained the excess value of her home above her tax debt in violation of the Takings Clause of the Fifth Amendment and the Excessive Fines Clause of the Eighth Amendment."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Supreme Court",
      "case_id": "2022-22-166",
